1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Forty-Ninth Episode
Lord X
Hecate's Smile

15
00:02:08,294 --> 00:02:09,431
<i>The X-Union.</i>

16
00:02:09,455 --> 00:02:13,180
<i>Its forces have finally approached the border of Silverland.</i>

17
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:30,552
<i>The massive X-Union army has destroyed Demon Mountain in its path,</i>

18
00:02:30,576 --> 00:02:33,946
<i>and now nothing stands between them and the invasion of Silverland.</i>

19
00:02:36,980 --> 00:02:38,458
Commander Ghana, sir!

20
00:02:39,562 --> 00:02:41,660
Commander a message from headquarters!

21
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:45,159
We are ordered to conquer Demon Mountain before the main force arrives.

22
00:02:45,366 --> 00:02:46,640
All right, good work!

23
00:02:48,279 --> 00:02:49,259
Demon Mountain?

24
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,360
Move out!

25
00:03:05,079 --> 00:03:06,259
Fire!

26
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:12,126
Onward! Charge!

27
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:20,860
Glad you could make it, Hecate.

28
00:03:20,929 --> 00:03:24,166
Sapphire, why are you practicing with bows and spears?

29
00:03:24,375 --> 00:03:26,598
Because the X-Union is going to attack Silverland,

30
00:03:26,622 --> 00:03:27,880
so I have to protect my kingdom.

31
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:30,026
I guess there are bad humans too.

32
00:03:30,886 --> 00:03:32,560
Yeah, that's right.

33
00:03:35,860 --> 00:03:39,680
But humans can care for each other and fall in love, right?

34
00:03:40,294 --> 00:03:41,580
That's true.

35
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,893
Humans are wonderful, aren't they?

36
00:03:44,580 --> 00:03:44,926
Yeah.

37
00:03:45,864 --> 00:03:49,560
Hecate, there's nothing wrong with you falling in love with a human, either.

38
00:03:50,373 --> 00:03:52,580
To fall in love with a human...

39
00:03:53,990 --> 00:03:56,652
Lord Sapphire, it is time for the meeting.

40
00:03:56,676 --> 00:03:58,226
Is it that time already?

41
00:03:58,450 --> 00:03:59,973
Well, see you later, Sapphire.

42
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:03,140
All right, let's meet in the forest by the mountain in one week.

43
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:03,840
All right.

44
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:10,040
Hecate, you be careful of the X-Union too, okay?

45
00:04:10,570 --> 00:04:12,060
Yeah, you too, Sapphire.

46
00:04:38,850 --> 00:04:42,700
Sapphire told me that even I could fall in love.

47
00:04:43,369 --> 00:04:44,105
La la la

48
00:04:44,129 --> 00:04:45,105
La la la la

49
00:04:45,129 --> 00:04:47,122
La la

50
00:05:12,613 --> 00:05:13,393
Hecate!

51
00:05:13,634 --> 00:05:14,112
Oh,

52
00:05:14,136 --> 00:05:15,286
Papa, Mama!

53
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:18,020
Hecate, what are you thinking?

54
00:05:21,210 --> 00:05:23,445
Hecate, it's no use hiding it.

55
00:05:23,469 --> 00:05:26,060
I can see right through your heart.

56
00:05:26,675 --> 00:05:29,260
You're trying to fall in love with a human.

57
00:05:31,059 --> 00:05:31,920
Huh?

58
00:05:32,940 --> 00:05:34,052
No, Mama...

59
00:05:34,076 --> 00:05:35,125
Don't lie.

60
00:05:35,149 --> 00:05:36,805
You're a demon's daughter.

61
00:05:36,829 --> 00:05:39,118
If you fall in love with a human,

62
00:05:39,142 --> 00:05:41,320
the Great Demon King will punish you terribly.

63
00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:45,660
Mama, tell Hecate how terrifying the Great Demon King's punishment is.

64
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:48,466
What's the Great Demon King's punishment?

65
00:05:50,910 --> 00:05:55,640
The punishment the Great Demon King inflicts on us is truly terrifying.

66
00:06:07,090 --> 00:06:08,632
Got that, Hecate?

67
00:06:08,656 --> 00:06:10,640
Don't disobey your parents.

68
00:06:11,385 --> 00:06:13,193
All right, Papa, Mama.

69
00:06:13,770 --> 00:06:15,418
All right, then.

70
00:06:15,442 --> 00:06:17,900
We're off to the Demon Convention.

71
00:06:18,005 --> 00:06:19,186
Hey, wait a minute.

72
00:06:19,305 --> 00:06:21,392
Hurry up, or we'll be late.

73
00:06:21,416 --> 00:06:24,112
Take this snake charm with you so I'll know if anything happens to you.

74
00:06:24,136 --> 00:06:29,280
It's set up to alert me right away if something goes wrong.

75
00:06:33,540 --> 00:06:36,893
Off you go, Papa! Mama!

76
00:06:40,590 --> 00:06:42,960
Commander! The demons have left!

77
00:06:43,165 --> 00:06:45,640
Right! Bring down that mountain! Ready to fire!

78
00:06:56,569 --> 00:06:57,305
Hecate,

79
00:06:57,876 --> 00:06:59,565
you are a demon's daughter.

80
00:07:00,095 --> 00:07:02,232
If you fall in love with a human,

81
00:07:02,256 --> 00:07:05,640
the Great Demon King will punish you horribly.

82
00:07:09,510 --> 00:07:11,040
Oh, but Mama...

83
00:07:15,470 --> 00:07:16,820
Fire! Keep firing!

84
00:07:24,010 --> 00:07:25,886
Help me! Papa! Mama!

85
00:07:26,300 --> 00:07:27,445
Fire! Fire! Fire!

86
00:07:27,469 --> 00:07:29,340
Destroy Demon Mountain!

87
00:07:45,620 --> 00:07:46,620
It's a demon's daughter!

88
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,000
A demon!

89
00:07:49,660 --> 00:07:50,740
Prepare yourself, demon!

90
00:07:51,035 --> 00:07:52,960
You're a witch, so you're going to burn at the stake!

91
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,000
Or do you want to fight?!

92
00:07:54,540 --> 00:07:55,515
Help me!

93
00:07:55,540 --> 00:07:56,540
Prepare yourself!

94
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:57,873
Wait!

95
00:08:03,010 --> 00:08:03,712
What are you doing?

96
00:08:03,736 --> 00:08:04,300
Let her go!

97
00:08:05,170 --> 00:08:06,625
But Commander,

98
00:08:06,649 --> 00:08:08,040
she's a witch!

99
00:08:08,605 --> 00:08:09,878
Witch or not,

100
00:08:09,902 --> 00:08:11,020
she's just a girl!

101
00:08:11,021 --> 00:08:12,291
What about, the invasion?

102
00:08:12,316 --> 00:08:14,358
We must consult Lord X first.

103
00:08:14,915 --> 00:08:16,460
Leave this to me for now.

104
00:08:21,913 --> 00:08:23,740
Hey, miss, show me your arm.

105
00:08:24,140 --> 00:08:25,073
Are you all right?

106
00:08:25,670 --> 00:08:27,512
Someone fetch the medical kit!

107
00:08:27,722 --> 00:08:29,340
It'll turn bad if we leave it like this.

108
00:08:35,739 --> 00:08:36,900
Prepare a horse for her.

109
00:08:37,775 --> 00:08:40,460
Now, miss, I must take you to Lord X.

110
00:08:40,909 --> 00:08:42,371
Come with us quietly.

111
00:08:42,395 --> 00:08:43,100
Got it?

112
00:08:44,179 --> 00:08:45,180
Yes.

113
00:08:49,969 --> 00:08:51,246
Miss, what is your name?

114
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:53,780
My name is Hecate.

115
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:55,593
Hecate...

116
00:08:57,060 --> 00:08:58,060
Hecate...

117
00:08:58,420 --> 00:08:59,420
That's a nice name.

118
00:08:59,545 --> 00:09:00,405
And you?

119
00:09:04,399 --> 00:09:05,760
Me? I'm Ghana.

120
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,120
Let's go!

121
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:09,660
Forward!

122
00:09:14,746 --> 00:09:17,306
Something must have happened to Hecate!

123
00:09:17,330 --> 00:09:19,606
My charm broke, after all.

124
00:09:19,983 --> 00:09:21,680
I certainly hope not...

125
00:09:27,139 --> 00:09:28,940
It's gone! Our house is gone!

126
00:09:34,810 --> 00:09:36,009
Hecate!

127
00:09:36,199 --> 00:09:37,940
Could she have been kidnapped by someone?

128
00:09:38,035 --> 00:09:40,080
There are tracks from a large group passing through.

129
00:09:40,550 --> 00:09:42,260
All right, let's go after them!

130
00:09:48,609 --> 00:09:50,300
There it is! Hecate is there, too!

131
00:09:52,099 --> 00:09:53,600
All right, just you wait!

132
00:10:16,260 --> 00:10:18,340
A demon! A demon! This is a demon's work!

133
00:10:20,910 --> 00:10:22,472
Did you see my power?

134
00:10:22,496 --> 00:10:24,940
If you don't return my beloved daughter Hecate...

135
00:10:25,180 --> 00:10:26,900
I'll make you suffer even more!

136
00:10:31,540 --> 00:10:32,793
How many times do I have to tell you?

137
00:10:43,569 --> 00:10:46,420
Ah, Mephisto, was it? Thank you for coming.

138
00:10:46,805 --> 00:10:48,180
Who are you?!

139
00:10:48,535 --> 00:10:51,339
I am X, a human demon.

140
00:10:51,363 --> 00:10:56,460
Like you, I seek to build a world of evil on Earth.

141
00:10:57,765 --> 00:10:58,944
A world of evil?

142
00:10:59,636 --> 00:11:00,960
Indeed, Mephisto.

143
00:11:02,729 --> 00:11:04,619
We shall bring this world under evil's rule.

144
00:11:05,323 --> 00:11:07,540
Starting with Silverland.

145
00:11:10,699 --> 00:11:11,663
What do you say, Mephisto?

146
00:11:12,207 --> 00:11:13,880
Why not join forces with me?

147
00:11:14,729 --> 00:11:19,620
How fascinating. If you're serious, I'd be happy to help.

148
00:11:23,029 --> 00:11:25,636
We'll gladly lend you our aid. But first...

149
00:11:25,660 --> 00:11:29,840
yes, first we want our daughter Hecate returned.

150
00:11:30,620 --> 00:11:32,456
Very well, I'll return her.

151
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:35,816
Provided you fulfill my condition...

152
00:11:36,140 --> 00:11:37,081
 A condition!?

153
00:11:37,209 --> 00:11:39,556
Capture Princess Sapphire of Silverland,

154
00:11:39,580 --> 00:11:41,539
and I will give back your daughter.

155
00:11:50,375 --> 00:11:52,680
Hello there, little birds. How are you?

156
00:11:53,539 --> 00:11:57,046
I'm supposed to meet Hecate here today, little birds.

157
00:11:57,930 --> 00:12:02,380
But she's late. It's way past the time we agreed on.

158
00:12:11,900 --> 00:12:12,900
What's wrong?

159
00:12:15,560 --> 00:12:16,620
What's that?

160
00:12:19,009 --> 00:12:22,460
Sapphire! We're in luck finding you in a place like this.

161
00:12:22,680 --> 00:12:23,373
You demons!

162
00:12:23,589 --> 00:12:25,180
Zubarosha!

163
00:12:49,495 --> 00:12:50,806
Where on earth am I...?

164
00:12:52,473 --> 00:12:53,580
That's right!

165
00:12:53,845 --> 00:12:58,480
Mephisto captured me and brought me to this X-Union tent.

166
00:12:59,645 --> 00:13:01,620
I have to find a way to escape!

167
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:08,020
If we let Sapphire escape, Lord X will have our heads!

168
00:13:16,829 --> 00:13:19,776
You've done well, Mephisto.

169
00:13:21,247 --> 00:13:23,930
X, now that we have captured Sapphire,

170
00:13:23,954 --> 00:13:26,370
Silverland is practically ours for the taking.

171
00:13:26,847 --> 00:13:30,199
Indeed, it is all thanks to you and your group.

172
00:13:34,739 --> 00:13:35,660
Sapphire...

173
00:13:38,849 --> 00:13:40,420
I have to save Sapphire...

174
00:13:42,550 --> 00:13:45,660
That must be the tent where Sapphire is being held.

175
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:47,363
Wait... it's you!

176
00:13:47,387 --> 00:13:49,443
What are you doing here, Hecate?

177
00:13:49,467 --> 00:13:50,940
You were watching Sapphire's tent.

178
00:13:51,595 --> 00:13:55,570
Please, help Sapphire. She's my friend.

179
00:13:55,594 --> 00:13:59,320
Hecate, I... No, I can't possibly do that.

180
00:13:59,321 --> 00:14:02,440
Ghana, even if the person giving you orders is evil...

181
00:14:03,009 --> 00:14:06,340
Fine then, Ghana. I'll save Sapphire myself.

182
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:07,560
Hecate!

183
00:14:18,169 --> 00:14:20,220
What a troublesome girl. Stay here.

184
00:14:32,900 --> 00:14:33,900
Hecate!

185
00:14:35,039 --> 00:14:36,780
Save the talk for outside, hurry!

186
00:14:36,975 --> 00:14:38,040
Hecate, hurry!

187
00:14:51,969 --> 00:14:53,880
It's Sapphire! Sapphire has escaped!

188
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:56,620
Hold it!

189
00:14:58,179 --> 00:15:00,680
This is bad! At this rate, all three of us will get caught!

190
00:15:02,215 --> 00:15:03,600
Stop right there!

191
00:15:04,300 --> 00:15:05,340
All right!

192
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:12,000
Come on! You're not getting past me!

193
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:12,780
What?!

194
00:15:13,115 --> 00:15:14,360
You traitor!

195
00:15:17,539 --> 00:15:18,920
Hecate, run!

196
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:23,400
Sapphire, we'll be safe once we reach the Black Forest.

197
00:15:23,865 --> 00:15:25,220
I wonder if Ghana is okay.

198
00:15:30,460 --> 00:15:31,345
What?

199
00:15:31,889 --> 00:15:33,633
Ghana let Sapphire escape?!

200
00:15:34,379 --> 00:15:35,802
What are you all dawdling for?

201
00:15:35,826 --> 00:15:37,720
Go catch Sapphire!

202
00:15:40,065 --> 00:15:44,000
X, panicking won't help you catch Sapphire now.

203
00:15:45,315 --> 00:15:49,180
Lord X, that demon's daughter over there helped Sapphire escape too.

204
00:15:49,570 --> 00:15:50,570
What? What did you say?

205
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,200
Where's Hecate?

206
00:15:54,809 --> 00:15:59,460
Mephisto, it seems your daughter put Ghana up to this.

207
00:16:00,025 --> 00:16:02,340
This is a bad situation, Mephisto.

208
00:16:04,909 --> 00:16:08,520
All right, I have a plan. Lend me Ghana downstairs.

209
00:16:08,975 --> 00:16:10,400
I'll bring Sapphire back for sure.

210
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:14,280
And we'll handle this alone, so promise you won't get in our way.

211
00:16:14,639 --> 00:16:16,700
Very well. Take Ghana with you.

212
00:16:17,375 --> 00:16:19,300
I certainly promise you, X.

213
00:16:26,159 --> 00:16:28,520
I wonder if Sapphire and Hecate will come here.

214
00:16:28,700 --> 00:16:31,363
Don't worry. If we take Ghana there,

215
00:16:31,387 --> 00:16:34,940
 soft-hearted Sapphire and Hecate are sure to show up.

216
00:16:35,835 --> 00:16:37,373
Zubarasha!

217
00:16:47,819 --> 00:16:48,860
Eraisha!

218
00:16:52,100 --> 00:16:55,370
Now Sapphire and Hecate will know Ghana is here.

219
00:16:55,394 --> 00:16:57,520
Why would you start a fire...?

220
00:16:57,569 --> 00:16:58,316
Look at that.

221
00:16:59,074 --> 00:17:05,200
My magical fog and fire project Ghana's giant form into the night sky.

222
00:17:08,279 --> 00:17:11,139
Oh, look, Sapphire! Ghana! It's Ghana!

223
00:17:12,899 --> 00:17:14,586
Ghana! Ghana!

224
00:17:16,089 --> 00:17:19,520
Ghana, so you really were captured after all.

225
00:17:19,659 --> 00:17:20,363
Hecate,

226
00:17:20,794 --> 00:17:23,603
you like that commander,

227
00:17:24,947 --> 00:17:25,480
don't you?

228
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:26,950
Yeah...

229
00:17:26,974 --> 00:17:31,866
But didn't I tell you before that even a demon can fall in love with a human?

230
00:17:32,939 --> 00:17:36,206
Anyway, it seems Ghana is beyond that mountain. Let's hurry, Hecate.

231
00:17:41,169 --> 00:17:41,650
They're here.

232
00:17:41,674 --> 00:17:44,236
Those footsteps must be Hecate and Sapphire.

233
00:17:44,260 --> 00:17:46,780
Let's wait and see what Hecate does.

234
00:17:46,913 --> 00:17:47,553
All right.

235
00:17:51,594 --> 00:17:52,594
Ghana!

236
00:17:54,389 --> 00:17:55,420
Ghana, I'm coming!

237
00:17:57,829 --> 00:17:59,120
Ghana! Ghana!

238
00:18:02,999 --> 00:18:03,660
Hecate!

239
00:18:05,269 --> 00:18:06,560
You're awake, Ghana.

240
00:18:07,129 --> 00:18:10,320
Hecate, stay back! It's dangerous! It's a trap! Run, hurry!

241
00:18:12,459 --> 00:18:14,940
What are you saying, Ghana? I'm going to save you.

242
00:18:15,279 --> 00:18:17,320
Hang in there, Hecate! Just a little more!

243
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:18,520
Hecate.

244
00:18:18,820 --> 00:18:19,460
Mephisto!

245
00:18:19,819 --> 00:18:21,350
Hecate, what are you doing?!

246
00:18:21,374 --> 00:18:23,539
After everything I told you! Come down right now!

247
00:18:24,054 --> 00:18:25,340
Papa, Mama!

248
00:18:25,779 --> 00:18:28,260
Come on, Hecate. Come down quickly.

249
00:18:28,424 --> 00:18:30,160
Don't you listen to us?!

250
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:32,120
Hecate.

251
00:18:34,579 --> 00:18:37,580
That's right, Hecate. Hurry and get down! Forget about me!

252
00:18:38,679 --> 00:18:41,580
Ghana, I can't just forget you!

253
00:18:43,229 --> 00:18:45,580
I can't, Papa, Mama!

254
00:18:46,620 --> 00:18:47,620
What?

255
00:18:48,159 --> 00:18:49,797
I'm sorry, Papa, Mama.

256
00:18:51,228 --> 00:18:52,480
I'm going to save Ghana!

257
00:18:52,904 --> 00:18:55,057
Hecate, you haven't forgotten what happens

258
00:18:55,081 --> 00:18:57,460
if you fall in love with a human, have you?!

259
00:18:58,229 --> 00:19:01,620
Hecate, Papa made a deal with X! Hurry up and come down!

260
00:19:01,864 --> 00:19:03,206
A deal with X?

261
00:19:03,409 --> 00:19:06,820
What? Mephisto! X isn't the kind of man to keep a promise! Look at that!

262
00:19:20,049 --> 00:19:23,060
It's about time. Are you ready to attack?

263
00:19:23,969 --> 00:19:24,873
Do it!

264
00:19:30,999 --> 00:19:32,993
Damn it! Hey! That bastard X!

265
00:19:38,549 --> 00:19:40,900
Hecate! We have to get Ghana down, quick!

266
00:19:42,109 --> 00:19:44,000
Hecate! Hurry, hurry! It's dangerous!

267
00:19:45,379 --> 00:19:46,460
Hecate! Are you all right?

268
00:19:47,359 --> 00:19:49,100
Hang in there, Ghana! Just a little more!

269
00:19:49,514 --> 00:19:50,520
Hecate, it won't untie!

270
00:19:52,589 --> 00:19:53,726
What are you doing, Hecate?!

271
00:19:53,750 --> 00:19:54,820
It's dangerous! Get down, quick!

272
00:19:54,974 --> 00:19:56,459
More cannonballs are coming!

273
00:19:56,483 --> 00:19:58,153
Get down, Hecate!

274
00:19:59,969 --> 00:20:01,740
Curse that hateful X!

275
00:20:02,849 --> 00:20:04,152
Now I'll blow you away!

276
00:20:04,176 --> 00:20:05,640
Traitors, watch this!

277
00:20:14,736 --> 00:20:16,283
<i>Matte Mephisto!
- Stop Mephisto!</i>

278
00:20:17,559 --> 00:20:19,886
<i>Omae ga X o yattsuketara,
- If you defeat X,</i>

279
00:20:19,910 --> 00:20:23,799
<i>ningen o aishita Hecate no mikata o shita koto ni naru zo
- it means you've taken the side of Hecate, who loves a human!</i>

280
00:20:25,303 --> 00:20:29,872
<i>Omae ga X o yattsukereba, washi no batsu o ukeneba naran.
- If you defeat X, you must face my punishment.</i>

281
00:20:30,430 --> 00:20:32,272
<i>Soredemo yoi no ka?
- Are you truly prepared for that?</i>

282
00:20:32,836 --> 00:20:35,673
<i>Omaetachi wa X no mikata o suru nda!
- You will side with X!</i>

283
00:20:40,779 --> 00:20:42,180
Come on, hurry, Ghana!

284
00:20:43,599 --> 00:20:44,960
Thank goodness, Ghana.

285
00:20:45,489 --> 00:20:47,040
Thank you. Is Hecate okay?

286
00:20:47,400 --> 00:20:48,400
Thank goodness!

287
00:21:05,639 --> 00:21:06,306
Hecate!

288
00:21:06,717 --> 00:21:07,360
Hecate!

289
00:21:07,890 --> 00:21:08,413
Hecate!

290
00:21:08,531 --> 00:21:12,500
Don't die! Hecate! Hecate! Don't die!

291
00:21:12,619 --> 00:21:14,040
Damn it! Curse you, X!

292
00:21:16,854 --> 00:21:18,326
Impudent humans!

293
00:21:18,770 --> 00:21:20,600
You won't get away with mocking a demon!

294
00:21:20,814 --> 00:21:23,046
Behold my final magic!

295
00:21:24,156 --> 00:21:26,156
Zubarasha!

296
00:21:30,579 --> 00:21:32,006
Papa!

297
00:21:59,141 --> 00:22:00,680
Wow, well done!

298
00:22:00,990 --> 00:22:02,527
Hecate, watch your mama's magic carefully!

299
00:22:02,551 --> 00:22:03,238
Mama!

300
00:22:07,280 --> 00:22:11,060
Mizu yo! Mizu yo! Sakamake! Uzumake!
- Water! Water! Surge! Swirl!

301
00:22:11,599 --> 00:22:13,760
Zubarasha!

302
00:22:53,709 --> 00:22:58,091
What foolish demons, sacrificing their own lives.

303
00:22:58,382 --> 00:22:59,459
We must retreat for now.

304
00:23:15,589 --> 00:23:19,680
Noroware! Dai-mao no okite o yabutta oroka na yatsura!
- Be cursed, you fools who broke the Great Demon King's law!

305
00:23:20,709 --> 00:23:23,600
Dai-mao no batsu to shite—Mephisto...!
- As punishment from the Great Demon King—Mephisto...!

306
00:23:24,439 --> 00:23:25,658
Omae wa yama!
- You shall become a mountain!

307
00:23:25,682 --> 00:23:26,591
Hell,

308
00:23:26,615 --> 00:23:28,325
Omae wa mizumi!
- you shall become a lake!

309
00:23:28,349 --> 00:23:31,940
Eikyu ni moto no akuma ni modorenai yo ni shite yaru!
- You will never return to your demonic forms!

310
00:23:32,787 --> 00:23:33,398
Hecate yo
- Hecate,

311
00:23:34,302 --> 00:23:38,340
omae ni mo nido to akuma ni modorenai batsu o kurete yaru!
- I shall punish you too so you can never be a demon again!

312
00:23:39,169 --> 00:23:41,665
Omae wa toki ga tateba shinde shimau, 
- You shall become a pitiful human

313
00:23:41,929 --> 00:23:44,080
aware na ningen ni naru no da!
- who will grow old and die!

314
00:23:54,959 --> 00:23:56,231
Papa!

315
00:23:56,902 --> 00:23:58,653
Mama!

316
00:23:59,919 --> 00:24:06,145
Hecate, your Papa and Mama cast that rainbow wishing for your happiness.

317
00:24:06,169 --> 00:24:07,680
They are saying...

318
00:24:08,164 --> 00:24:11,520
Go into the human world and be happy with Ghana.

319
